        78.16929626464844,
        314.8992919921875,
        494.5188293457031,
        329.3423156738281
      ],
      "text": "CXR with human reader 0.89–0.96 0.36–0.63",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.67303466796875,
        237.4468994140625,
        354.1770324707031
      ],
      "text": "CAD: computer-aided detection; CXR: chest X-ray.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.0796203613281,
        527.2693481445312,
        379.52264404296875
      ],
      "text": "The results showed the variability of both human readers and CAD software programmes across",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.27960205078125,
        527.3185424804688,
        392.7226257324219
      ],
      "text": "different settings and populations. In comparing the range of accuracy of CAD to that of human readers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.4796142578125,
        527.4035034179688,
        405.9226379394531
      ],
      "text": "interpreting CXRs and noting the variability of readers and the substantial overlap between the two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.6795959472656,
        527.4442749023438,
        419.12261962890625
      ],
      "text": "ranges, the data suggested there is little difference between the two. Therefore, the GDG considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.8796081542969,
        519.832275390625,
        432.3226318359375
      ],
      "text": "that CAD software programmes can be considered accurate when compared with human readers.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.58349609375,
        527.4332885742188,
        454.0265197753906
      ],
      "text": "Other desirable effects beyond the accuracy of the technologies would likely include the possibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.78350830078125,
        527.4276733398438,
        467.2265319824219
      ],
      "text": "to scale up and thus increase the access to chest radiography, given the scarcity of radiologists in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.9835205078125,
        527.5609741210938,
        480.4265441894531
      ],
      "text": "many settings. In addition, GDG members noted that in many settings, general practitioners or other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999099731445312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.1835021972656,
        527.415771484375,
        493.62652587890625
      ],
      "text": "providers without specific training in radiology are often tasked with interpreting chest radiographs,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.3835144042969,
        527.6018676757812,
        506.8265380859375
      ],
      "text": "and they may not be as highly skilled as the readers used for comparison in the evaluations considered,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950287818908691,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.58349609375,
        527.4102783203125,
        520.0264892578125
      ],
      "text": "thus indicating that the comparisons presented here may represent an underestimate of the true",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.7835083007812,
        327.3212890625,
        533.2265014648438
      ],
      "text": "comparative accuracy of CAD software for detecting TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.487548828125,
        527.438720703125,
        554.9305419921875
      ],
      "text": "The drawback of using CAD interpretation in place of human readers for chest radiographs included",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        553.6875,
        527.4452514648438,
        568.1304931640625
      ],
      "text": "the fact that it cannot detect other lung pathologies beyond TB. The capacity of CAD technologies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.8875122070312,
        527.5930786132812,
        581.3305053710938
      ],
      "text": "to simultaneously screen for multiple pulmonary or thoracic conditions could be attractive for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        580.0875244140625,
        527.40576171875,
        594.530517578125
      ],
      "text": "programmes, but no data on the performance of CAD for differential diagnosis were available to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.2874755859375,
        173.10011291503906,
        607.73046875
      ],
      "text": "assessed by the GDG.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.9913940429688,
        527.394775390625,
        629.4343872070312
      ],
      "text": "CAD technologies have the potential to increase equity in the reach of TB screening interventions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.19140625,
        527.4497680664062,
        642.6343994140625
      ],
      "text": "and in access to TB care if they facilitate the scale up of radiography for TB screening and triage and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.3914184570312,
        241.26632690429688,
        655.8344116210938
      ],
      "text": "improve the interpretation of images.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.0953369140625,
        527.5716552734375,
        677.538330078125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation applies to software brands that upon external validation demonstrate a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.2952880859375,
        527.4356689453125,
        690.73828125
      ],
      "text": "performance that is not inferior to the products reviewed by the GDG in 2020. The analysis for this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.4954223632812,
        527.4344482421875,
        703.9384155273438
      ],
      "text": "recommendation was restricted to bacteriologically confirmed TB and, thus, the recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.6953125,
        527.3717651367188,
        717.1383056640625
      ],
      "text": "may not necessarily apply to other forms of TB (e.g. exclusively extrapulmonary TB, clinically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.8953247070312,
        527.4122924804688,
        730.3383178710938
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed TB). This recommendation is specific to adults and adolescents aged 15 years and older.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        729.0953369140625,
        527.4002685546875,
        743.538330078125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation applies only to the interpretation of anteroposterior or posteroanterior views",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.2952880859375,
        527.38037109375,
        756.73828125
      ],
      "text": "of digital plain CXRs for pulmonary TB: it does not apply to the interpretation of lateral or oblique",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.4954223632812,
        427.2563171386719,
        769.9384155273438
      ],
      "text": "views, and its applicability to the interpretation of analogue CXRs is unknown.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        293.323486328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for tools for systematic screening for TB disease 27",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
